In [[3 BBY]],<ref name="Timelines">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]''</ref> [[Ryder Azadi]] lived in a makeshift '''hideout''' hidden in a mountainous area on the [[planet]] [[Lothal]] after [[Revolt in an Imperial prison|escaping]] from [[prison]]. He and his pet [[Loth-cat]] initially hid out there after he escaped an [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] prison with the help of [[Ephraim Bridger|Ephraim]] and [[Mira Bridger]] and returned to his [[homeworld]]. When their son [[Ezra Bridger|Ezra]] returned to Lothal looking for his parents, he eventually tracked down Ryder at the hideout.<ref name="Legacy" /> Later, Ryder was forced to abandon the hideout after Imperial troops tracked him down there. The [[Spectres]], the rebel cell Ezra had joined, helped Ryder escape from Imperial forces.<ref name="A Princess on Lothal">{{Rebels|A Princess on Lothal}}</ref>

